    "title": "Say farewell to East End Arts gallery space at 133 E. Main St. - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By RiverheadLOCAL ,\n1 days ago East End Arts invites the community to say farewell to its gallery space at 133 E. Main Street and take part in the final art installation in the gallery before Riverhead Revitalization construction begins. The farewell event takes place at the gallery on April 11, from 4 to 7 p.m. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
